<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>每日faq - 沙雕园</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5faq/</link><description>欢迎来到沙雕园。本博客要素较多，包括但不限于数学、编程、游戏、吐槽、冲塔、科普、整活。</description><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5faq/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>#每日faq Q：自来水不能喝，苹果不洗不能吃，但为什么自来水洗…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-111576994333432665/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-111576994333432665/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5faq" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日faq&lt;/span>&lt;/a>&lt;br>Q：自来水不能喝，苹果不洗不能吃，但为什么自来水洗过的屁股可以吃。&lt;br>A：这是典型的偷换概念。&lt;br>自来水=大量自来水（不能喝）+少量自来水&lt;br>苹果=表皮的脏东西（不能吃）+能吃的部分&lt;br>自来水+苹果=（能吃的部分+少量自来水）+（脏东西+大量自来水）=干净的苹果+污水&lt;br>&lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/2ed4d525f5ad0fdaa44f.png" alt=":annoyingdog:" title=":annoyingdog:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>